Package: gamlss.longitudinal
Type: Package
Title: Fit Longitudinal Data Using GAMLSS Margins and Copula Dependence Structures
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Aydin Sareff-Hibbert
Maintainer: Aydin Sareff-Hibbert <aydin.hibbert@sydney.edu.au>
Description: Fits longitudinal Gaussian additive models for location, scale and shape (GAMLSS)
    with flexible copula dependence structures across time. Supports various copula
    families (Gaussian, Clayton, Frank, Gumbel, Joe) with custom links and includes
    comprehensive diagnostic and visualization tools.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    gamlss,
    gamlss.dist,
    gamlss2,
    VineCopula,
    rlang,
    latex2exp,
    ggplot2,
    ggpubr,
    MASS,
    mgcv,
    scales,
    methods,
    utils,
    stats,
    graphics
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
